ons \u2022 Survive the \u2018Nightmare\u2019 difficulty mode, on console for the first time \u2022 Fight for your life in the new \u2018Survival Arena\u2019 mode. Use new weapons and tactics to overcome waves of zombies, scoring in online-leaderboards", "summary": "A zombie outbreak eradicated all hope of returning life back to normal, now only survival lives on. Run, hide and fight your way through the undead as Randall searches for his family in this gorgeous, gritty, destroyed world.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/deadlight-directors-cut", "videos": [{"id": 8631, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "EZm9JevWrEw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EZm9JevWrEw", "title": "Deadlight: Directors Cut - Launch Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EZm9JevWrEw/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 8340, "name": "Survival Arena Trailer", "video_id": "ZrOuIjX6RZU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZrOuIjX6RZU", "title": "Deadlight: Directors Cut - Survival Arena Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZrOuIjX6RZU/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 72505, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "OSdVVPbVyuQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OSdVVPbVyuQ", "title": "Deadlight: Director's Cut Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/OSdVVPbVyuQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 2176, "name": "Deadlight"}]}